I see, that solves this immediate problem. But there is another problem. If I set the environment variable TMPDIR to some specific location on HDFS, e.g. /user/hduser/tmp, I cannot do it, because I don't have /user/hduser/tmp on my local file system. This is a problem in itself; furthermore, it gets exacerbated if I also need to use tempdir() for my own code.

The problem is essentially that with this approach, the directory containing temp files has to be the same both on the local file system and on HDFS.

Following your previous advice, should I open an issue in the issue tracker in this case?

Thanks,
M

