Thanks for the additional information. I entered issue #27 <https://github.com/RevolutionAnalytics/rmr2/issues/27> to track development of this feature. I described it as a general ability to pass options to Rscript, which is what is invoked by hadoop on the task nodes. Could you please verify that Rscript accepts the options you need on the cmd line? Thanks

Antonio

