Hi Chuck,
a few suggestions
1. Don't mix format code and algorithm code. Define an input format appropriate for your data
2. Return something. If you return NULL, you get NULL.
3. Don't loop on the rows. What is the point of writing an inefficient program for Hadoop?

That's all I have. I will let other group members chip in if they have other suggestions.

Antonio

