the file named "tests.txt". Since there isn't a concept of a current directory in hdfs, if you are using the hadoop backend using absolute paths is highly recommended.

> Then what is exactly the output from reduce an how should I reduce in every phase knowing that map outputs one time for each array (from node) value.

